msgid "Idle Hidden Bars"
msgstr ""

#: IdleHiddenBars.gpr.py:28
msgid ""
"A monkey patch so that a hidden sidebar or bottombar does no work: its "
"gramplet stops updating while the bar is hidden and catches up when the bar "
"is shown again. Undocked gramplets keep updating."
msgstr ""
